  "identity": "WU Counters Go-Wide. This build spends its second spell each turn on BOARD rather than on cards: Cosmogrand Zenith makes two 1/1 Soldiers or puts a +1/+1 counter on every creature, Station Monitor adds a 1/1 flying Drone, and Sunstar Lightsmith grows while replacing the card that triggered it. Around that engine sit permanent-counter placers - Rayblade Trooper, Dockworker Drone, Honor and Luxknight Breacher, which enters with a counter for each other creature and artifact you already control - so the board grows in two dimensions at once. Exalted Sunborn doubles every token the engine makes, and two copies of Zealous Display convert the accumulated width into lethal in a single attack step.",
